[
  {
    "start": "00:00:01.533",
    "end": "00:00:03.566",
    "start_seconds": 1.533,
    "end_seconds": 3.566,
    "text": "Jocelyn Tyson,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.566",
    "end": "00:00:05.400",
    "start_seconds": 3.566,
    "end_seconds": 5.4,
    "text": "\"Have You Been There?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.400",
    "end": "00:00:06.766",
    "start_seconds": 5.4,
    "end_seconds": 6.766,
    "text": "\"Have You Been There?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.766",
    "end": "00:00:16.600",
    "start_seconds": 6.766,
    "end_seconds": 16.6,
    "text": "Jocelyn Tyson."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.666",
    "end": "00:00:17.066",
    "start_seconds": 16.666,
    "end_seconds": 17.066,
    "text": "Thank you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.066",
    "end": "00:00:18.400",
    "start_seconds": 17.066,
    "end_seconds": 18.4,
    "text": "Contest Chair."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.400",
    "end": "00:00:22.133",
    "start_seconds": 18.4,
    "end_seconds": 22.133,
    "text": "You're welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.233",
    "end": "00:00:26.966",
    "start_seconds": 22.233,
    "end_seconds": 26.966,
    "text": "It was the summer of 2021, and I was reaching a milestone birthday."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.033",
    "end": "00:00:31.166",
    "start_seconds": 27.033,
    "end_seconds": 31.166,
    "text": "I decided to skip the party and pick something epic off my bucket list:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.233",
    "end": "00:00:33.966",
    "start_seconds": 31.233,
    "end_seconds": 33.966,
    "text": "Triathlon."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.966",
    "end": "00:00:35.733",
    "start_seconds": 33.966,
    "end_seconds": 35.733,
    "text": "For those of you unfamiliar, it is a race"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.733",
    "end": "00:00:39.666",
    "start_seconds": 35.733,
    "end_seconds": 39.666,
    "text": "that contains three disciplines: Swim, bike, run."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.733",
    "end": "00:00:44.966",
    "start_seconds": 39.733,
    "end_seconds": 44.966,
    "text": "Now, almost immediately, my inner go-getter said, \"Yeah, let's do this! Show 'em"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.966",
    "end": "00:00:48.466",
    "start_seconds": 44.966,
    "end_seconds": 48.466,
    "text": "you still got it.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.566",
    "end": "00:00:50.266",
    "start_seconds": 48.566,
    "end_seconds": 50.266,
    "text": "But my inner critic:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.266",
    "end": "00:00:52.400",
    "start_seconds": 50.266,
    "end_seconds": 52.4,
    "text": "\"Slow down, hot stuff."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.400",
    "end": "00:00:54.700",
    "start_seconds": 52.4,
    "end_seconds": 54.7,
    "text": "You hate swimming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.700",
    "end": "00:00:57.600",
    "start_seconds": 54.7,
    "end_seconds": 57.6,
    "text": "You barely bike, and girl,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.600",
    "end": "00:00:58.133",
    "start_seconds": 57.6,
    "end_seconds": 58.133,
    "text": "wait a minute,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.133",
    "end": "00:00:58.833",
    "start_seconds": 58.133,
    "end_seconds": 58.833,
    "text": "that swimming thing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.833",
    "end": "00:01:01.833",
    "start_seconds": 58.833,
    "end_seconds": 61.833,
    "text": "you can't do it!\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.066",
    "end": "00:01:05.266",
    "start_seconds": 62.066,
    "end_seconds": 65.266,
    "text": "And just like that, I had two warring sides,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.366",
    "end": "00:01:10.233",
    "start_seconds": 65.366,
    "end_seconds": 70.233,
    "text": "both with logical explanations for why I should or shouldn't do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.300",
    "end": "00:01:13.300",
    "start_seconds": 70.3,
    "end_seconds": 73.3,
    "text": "A decision to make. This one, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.533",
    "end": "00:01:18.200",
    "start_seconds": 73.533,
    "end_seconds": 78.2,
    "text": "That one, no. Have you been there?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.300",
    "end": "00:01:21.300",
    "start_seconds": 78.3,
    "end_seconds": 81.3,
    "text": "I decided to go with my inner go-getter."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.400",
    "end": "00:01:23.766",
    "start_seconds": 81.4,
    "end_seconds": 83.76599999999999,
    "text": "I signed up for the race. I started jogging,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.766",
    "end": "00:01:25.566",
    "start_seconds": 83.76599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 85.566,
    "text": "I borrowed a bike, and yes, friends,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.566",
    "end": "00:01:27.900",
    "start_seconds": 85.566,
    "end_seconds": 87.9,
    "text": "I took swim lessons."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.900",
    "end": "00:01:31.600",
    "start_seconds": 87.9,
    "end_seconds": 91.6,
    "text": "And after eight months straight of training every day,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.666",
    "end": "00:01:33.766",
    "start_seconds": 91.666,
    "end_seconds": 93.76599999999999,
    "text": "I was ready."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.766",
    "end": "00:01:35.200",
    "start_seconds": 93.76599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 95.2,
    "text": "It's race day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.200",
    "end": "00:01:36.733",
    "start_seconds": 95.2,
    "end_seconds": 96.733,
    "text": "People are lined up along the banks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.733",
    "end": "00:01:40.566",
    "start_seconds": 96.733,
    "end_seconds": 100.566,
    "text": "of a lake, ready to start the first part, the swim."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.633",
    "end": "00:01:44.533",
    "start_seconds": 100.63300000000001,
    "end_seconds": 104.533,
    "text": "They blow the whistle and the race is off."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.633",
    "end": "00:01:47.133",
    "start_seconds": 104.63300000000001,
    "end_seconds": 107.13300000000001,
    "text": "I, on the other hand, am still at the bank"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.133",
    "end": "00:01:49.966",
    "start_seconds": 107.13300000000001,
    "end_seconds": 109.96600000000001,
    "text": "of the lake. Why?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.966",
    "end": "00:01:50.933",
    "start_seconds": 109.96600000000001,
    "end_seconds": 110.93299999999999,
    "text": "You see, friends,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.933",
    "end": "00:01:54.666",
    "start_seconds": 110.93299999999999,
    "end_seconds": 114.666,
    "text": "my brain cannot seem to understand that the water, the dark,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.666",
    "end": "00:01:59.933",
    "start_seconds": 114.666,
    "end_seconds": 119.93299999999999,
    "text": "dreary, cedar water, was the same water that I had learned to swim in at the pool."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.033",
    "end": "00:02:01.866",
    "start_seconds": 120.033,
    "end_seconds": 121.866,
    "text": "There it was clear, you could see to the bottom."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.866",
    "end": "00:02:04.833",
    "start_seconds": 121.866,
    "end_seconds": 124.833,
    "text": "But this, this was darkness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.833",
    "end": "00:02:08.700",
    "start_seconds": 124.833,
    "end_seconds": 128.7,
    "text": "I go to put my face in and I couldn't do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.766",
    "end": "00:02:10.533",
    "start_seconds": 128.766,
    "end_seconds": 130.533,
    "text": "I couldn't do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.533",
    "end": "00:02:13.800",
    "start_seconds": 130.533,
    "end_seconds": 133.8,
    "text": "I started to panic."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.866",
    "end": "00:02:14.766",
    "start_seconds": 133.86599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 134.766,
    "text": "I look over to my right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.766",
    "end": "00:02:17.733",
    "start_seconds": 134.766,
    "end_seconds": 137.733,
    "text": "I see my family. They're looking back at me. What's wrong?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.733",
    "end": "00:02:18.933",
    "start_seconds": 137.733,
    "end_seconds": 138.933,
    "text": "I look over to the other side and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.933",
    "end": "00:02:21.433",
    "start_seconds": 138.933,
    "end_seconds": 141.433,
    "text": "I can see all the people lined up to see the start of the race."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.433",
    "end": "00:02:22.366",
    "start_seconds": 141.433,
    "end_seconds": 142.36599999999999,
    "text": "They're watching me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.366",
    "end": "00:02:25.366",
    "start_seconds": 142.36599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 145.36599999999999,
    "text": "And behind me are the people coming up for their next wave of the swim."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.533",
    "end": "00:02:28.233",
    "start_seconds": 145.53300000000002,
    "end_seconds": 148.233,
    "text": "I had a choice to make. Go forward into the water"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.233",
    "end": "00:02:28.866",
    "start_seconds": 148.233,
    "end_seconds": 148.86599999999999,
    "text": "or go back home"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.866",
    "end": "00:02:31.300",
    "start_seconds": 148.86599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 151.3,
    "text": "from where I came."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.300",
    "end": "00:02:33.166",
    "start_seconds": 151.3,
    "end_seconds": 153.166,
    "text": "A situation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.166",
    "end": "00:02:33.633",
    "start_seconds": 153.166,
    "end_seconds": 153.633,
    "text": "This one,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.633",
    "end": "00:02:36.300",
    "start_seconds": 153.633,
    "end_seconds": 156.3,
    "text": "yes. That one, no."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.300",
    "end": "00:02:37.900",
    "start_seconds": 156.3,
    "end_seconds": 157.9,
    "text": "Have you been there?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.900",
    "end": "00:02:41.800",
    "start_seconds": 157.9,
    "end_seconds": 161.8,
    "text": "I chose to do the only thing any would do with that logical situation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.866",
    "end": "00:02:48.100",
    "start_seconds": 161.86599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 168.1,
    "text": "I flipped over on my back and started the backstroke."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.166",
    "end": "00:02:50.866",
    "start_seconds": 168.166,
    "end_seconds": 170.86599999999999,
    "text": "Now, swimming"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.866",
    "end": "00:02:54.866",
    "start_seconds": 170.86599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 174.86599999999999,
    "text": "has a certain grace, a beauty, if you will."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.933",
    "end": "00:02:57.700",
    "start_seconds": 174.933,
    "end_seconds": 177.7,
    "text": "This had neither grace nor beauty."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.700",
    "end": "00:02:59.333",
    "start_seconds": 177.7,
    "end_seconds": 179.333,
    "text": "This was not swimming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.333",
    "end": "00:03:02.266",
    "start_seconds": 179.333,
    "end_seconds": 182.266,
    "text": "This was surviving."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.266",
    "end": "00:03:03.933",
    "start_seconds": 182.266,
    "end_seconds": 183.933,
    "text": "I'm knocking into people, bumping into things,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.933",
    "end": "00:03:05.100",
    "start_seconds": 183.933,
    "end_seconds": 185.1,
    "text": "knocking things over"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.100",
    "end": "00:03:09.866",
    "start_seconds": 185.1,
    "end_seconds": 189.86599999999999,
    "text": "and around, all things going on, all the while hyperventilating before I realize"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.933",
    "end": "00:03:11.833",
    "start_seconds": 189.933,
    "end_seconds": 191.833,
    "text": "I heard it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.933",
    "end": "00:03:18.333",
    "start_seconds": 191.933,
    "end_seconds": 198.333,
    "text": "\"Ma'am, you're going the wrong way!\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.400",
    "end": "00:03:20.866",
    "start_seconds": 198.4,
    "end_seconds": 200.86599999999999,
    "text": "All I could think to myself at that time was,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.866",
    "end": "00:03:24.633",
    "start_seconds": 200.86599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 204.633,
    "text": "I wonder who they're talking to."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.700",
    "end": "00:03:25.900",
    "start_seconds": 204.7,
    "end_seconds": 205.9,
    "text": "\"Ma'am,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.900",
    "end": "00:03:30.333",
    "start_seconds": 205.9,
    "end_seconds": 210.333,
    "text": "322, you're going the wrong way.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.400",
    "end": "00:03:33.033",
    "start_seconds": 210.4,
    "end_seconds": 213.03300000000002,
    "text": "322. No, no, I'm 322."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.033",
    "end": "00:03:33.800",
    "start_seconds": 213.03300000000002,
    "end_seconds": 213.8,
    "text": "I look over."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.800",
    "end": "00:03:35.833",
    "start_seconds": 213.8,
    "end_seconds": 215.833,
    "text": "I am 50 meters off course."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.833",
    "end": "00:03:37.833",
    "start_seconds": 215.833,
    "end_seconds": 217.833,
    "text": "Now in swim time that's not too bad,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.833",
    "end": "00:03:40.233",
    "start_seconds": 217.833,
    "end_seconds": 220.233,
    "text": "but for me, it was everything."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.233",
    "end": "00:03:42.033",
    "start_seconds": 220.233,
    "end_seconds": 222.03300000000002,
    "text": "I had to stop, get myself together,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.033",
    "end": "00:03:43.600",
    "start_seconds": 222.03300000000002,
    "end_seconds": 223.6,
    "text": "and I got back on course."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.600",
    "end": "00:03:46.833",
    "start_seconds": 223.6,
    "end_seconds": 226.833,
    "text": "Now, there are lifeguards spread out along the lake in canoes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.900",
    "end": "00:03:48.800",
    "start_seconds": 226.9,
    "end_seconds": 228.8,
    "text": "I swim up to one of the canoes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.800",
    "end": "00:03:50.433",
    "start_seconds": 228.8,
    "end_seconds": 230.433,
    "text": "The lifeguard, she looks over the boat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.433",
    "end": "00:03:55.066",
    "start_seconds": 230.433,
    "end_seconds": 235.066,
    "text": "She looks at me and says, \"Ma'am, you really need to think this through,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.066",
    "end": "00:03:57.666",
    "start_seconds": 235.066,
    "end_seconds": 237.666,
    "text": "okay? Look, you can still finish the race."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.666",
    "end": "00:03:59.900",
    "start_seconds": 237.666,
    "end_seconds": 239.9,
    "text": "We'll let you finish the bike. We'll let you finish the run."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.900",
    "end": "00:04:03.333",
    "start_seconds": 239.9,
    "end_seconds": 243.333,
    "text": "But you might want to think about quitting this.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.400",
    "end": "00:04:05.800",
    "start_seconds": 243.4,
    "end_seconds": 245.8,
    "text": "And I understood where she was coming from."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.800",
    "end": "00:04:08.033",
    "start_seconds": 245.8,
    "end_seconds": 248.033,
    "text": "There was a lot going on."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.033",
    "end": "00:04:11.033",
    "start_seconds": 248.033,
    "end_seconds": 251.033,
    "text": "My inner critic agreed with her all the more."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.266",
    "end": "00:04:13.433",
    "start_seconds": 251.266,
    "end_seconds": 253.433,
    "text": "\"You're in over your head,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.433",
    "end": "00:04:16.433",
    "start_seconds": 253.433,
    "end_seconds": 256.433,
    "text": "like 12 feet to be exact."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.533",
    "end": "00:04:19.533",
    "start_seconds": 256.533,
    "end_seconds": 259.533,
    "text": "Quitting sounds like a smart move right now.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.700",
    "end": "00:04:22.400",
    "start_seconds": 259.7,
    "end_seconds": 262.4,
    "text": "I looked up at her. I let go."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.400",
    "end": "00:04:24.800",
    "start_seconds": 262.4,
    "end_seconds": 264.8,
    "text": "I kept on swimming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.800",
    "end": "00:04:28.700",
    "start_seconds": 264.8,
    "end_seconds": 268.7,
    "text": "I went on for another few more meters before I grabbed hold of another canoe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.800",
    "end": "00:04:33.266",
    "start_seconds": 268.8,
    "end_seconds": 273.266,
    "text": "That lifeguard leaned over and she said to me, \"You're doing good."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.366",
    "end": "00:04:35.100",
    "start_seconds": 273.366,
    "end_seconds": 275.1,
    "text": "Not much further."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.100",
    "end": "00:04:38.600",
    "start_seconds": 275.1,
    "end_seconds": 278.6,
    "text": "You got this.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.700",
    "end": "00:04:40.533",
    "start_seconds": 278.7,
    "end_seconds": 280.533,
    "text": "Advice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.533",
    "end": "00:04:42.033",
    "start_seconds": 280.533,
    "end_seconds": 282.033,
    "text": "This one, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.033",
    "end": "00:04:43.800",
    "start_seconds": 282.033,
    "end_seconds": 283.8,
    "text": "That one, no."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.800",
    "end": "00:04:47.533",
    "start_seconds": 283.8,
    "end_seconds": 287.533,
    "text": "Have you been there?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.633",
    "end": "00:04:48.633",
    "start_seconds": 287.633,
    "end_seconds": 288.633,
    "text": "I let go."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.633",
    "end": "00:04:50.233",
    "start_seconds": 288.633,
    "end_seconds": 290.233,
    "text": "I finished the swim."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.233",
    "end": "00:04:53.000",
    "start_seconds": 290.233,
    "end_seconds": 293.0,
    "text": "I'm staggering up the bank. My legs feel like lead."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.000",
    "end": "00:04:54.933",
    "start_seconds": 293.0,
    "end_seconds": 294.933,
    "text": "My lungs are on fire."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.933",
    "end": "00:04:58.166",
    "start_seconds": 294.933,
    "end_seconds": 298.166,
    "text": "I'm coughing out water, all the while exhausted."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.400",
    "end": "00:05:01.266",
    "start_seconds": 298.4,
    "end_seconds": 301.266,
    "text": "I get to the bike. I fall up on top of the bike,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.266",
    "end": "00:05:04.200",
    "start_seconds": 301.266,
    "end_seconds": 304.2,
    "text": "one foot in front of the other as I pedal."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.200",
    "end": "00:05:08.266",
    "start_seconds": 304.2,
    "end_seconds": 308.266,
    "text": "To this day, I have no clue how I finished those 12 miles, but I got them done."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.366",
    "end": "00:05:12.133",
    "start_seconds": 308.366,
    "end_seconds": 312.133,
    "text": "When I finished, I tossed the bike to the side."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.200",
    "end": "00:05:14.266",
    "start_seconds": 312.2,
    "end_seconds": 314.266,
    "text": "I have now the run to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.266",
    "end": "00:05:18.000",
    "start_seconds": 314.266,
    "end_seconds": 318.0,
    "text": "At this point, my inner critic steps out bold and says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.166",
    "end": "00:05:21.066",
    "start_seconds": 318.166,
    "end_seconds": 321.066,
    "text": "\"You still have a third to do?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.066",
    "end": "00:05:23.033",
    "start_seconds": 321.066,
    "end_seconds": 323.033,
    "text": "You hate running."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.033",
    "end": "00:05:27.733",
    "start_seconds": 323.033,
    "end_seconds": 327.733,
    "text": "Why are we still here?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.833",
    "end": "00:05:29.066",
    "start_seconds": 327.83299999999997,
    "end_seconds": 329.066,
    "text": "At this point, my inner"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.066",
    "end": "00:05:32.066",
    "start_seconds": 329.066,
    "end_seconds": 332.06600000000003,
    "text": "go-getter steps out and says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.066",
    "end": "00:05:34.100",
    "start_seconds": 332.06600000000003,
    "end_seconds": 334.1,
    "text": "\"We only have a third left to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.100",
    "end": "00:05:36.266",
    "start_seconds": 334.1,
    "end_seconds": 336.266,
    "text": "You trained for this. Yes!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:36.266",
    "end": "00:05:39.900",
    "start_seconds": 336.266,
    "end_seconds": 339.9,
    "text": "Yes! We're still here.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.966",
    "end": "00:05:42.666",
    "start_seconds": 339.966,
    "end_seconds": 342.666,
    "text": "I shimmy, shod, struggle, trouble,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.666",
    "end": "00:05:47.366",
    "start_seconds": 342.666,
    "end_seconds": 347.366,
    "text": "stanky legs all the way across to clear that finish line."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.433",
    "end": "00:05:50.433",
    "start_seconds": 347.433,
    "end_seconds": 350.433,
    "text": "I had done what I intended."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.600",
    "end": "00:05:53.233",
    "start_seconds": 350.6,
    "end_seconds": 353.233,
    "text": "That race took a lot out of me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.233",
    "end": "00:05:56.766",
    "start_seconds": 353.233,
    "end_seconds": 356.766,
    "text": "but I took more out of it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.833",
    "end": "00:05:59.833",
    "start_seconds": 356.83299999999997,
    "end_seconds": 359.83299999999997,
    "text": "Whether you have to make a big decision,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.000",
    "end": "00:06:03.000",
    "start_seconds": 360.0,
    "end_seconds": 363.0,
    "text": "overcome a situation, take advice,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.033",
    "end": "00:06:06.033",
    "start_seconds": 363.033,
    "end_seconds": 366.033,
    "text": "or just finish what you started."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.233",
    "end": "00:06:09.133",
    "start_seconds": 366.233,
    "end_seconds": 369.133,
    "text": "These are things that can happen in life,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.133",
    "end": "00:06:12.300",
    "start_seconds": 369.133,
    "end_seconds": 372.3,
    "text": "can have two warring sides. This one,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.300",
    "end": "00:06:14.700",
    "start_seconds": 372.3,
    "end_seconds": 374.7,
    "text": "yes. That one, no."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.700",
    "end": "00:06:16.833",
    "start_seconds": 374.7,
    "end_seconds": 376.83299999999997,
    "text": "And both can come with logical explanations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.833",
    "end": "00:06:18.933",
    "start_seconds": 376.83299999999997,
    "end_seconds": 378.933,
    "text": "on what you should or shouldn't do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.933",
    "end": "00:06:20.900",
    "start_seconds": 378.933,
    "end_seconds": 380.9,
    "text": "Do I start a new job?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.900",
    "end": "00:06:22.866",
    "start_seconds": 380.9,
    "end_seconds": 382.866,
    "text": "Do I begin chemo?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.866",
    "end": "00:06:24.200",
    "start_seconds": 382.866,
    "end_seconds": 384.2,
    "text": "Do I finish chemo?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.200",
    "end": "00:06:27.633",
    "start_seconds": 384.2,
    "end_seconds": 387.633,
    "text": "Do I move? Do I start a new family?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:27.700",
    "end": "00:06:30.700",
    "start_seconds": 387.7,
    "end_seconds": 390.7,
    "text": "Whether you think you can or you think you can't."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.933",
    "end": "00:06:32.433",
    "start_seconds": 390.933,
    "end_seconds": 392.433,
    "text": "You're right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:32.433",
    "end": "00:06:34.800",
    "start_seconds": 392.433,
    "end_seconds": 394.8,
    "text": "It was said by Henry Ford,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.800",
    "end": "00:06:39.466",
    "start_seconds": 394.8,
    "end_seconds": 399.466,
    "text": "\"Because what matters most is what is within you.\" Friends,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.533",
    "end": "00:06:42.400",
    "start_seconds": 399.533,
    "end_seconds": 402.4,
    "text": "you can be your worst critic."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.400",
    "end": "00:06:46.000",
    "start_seconds": 402.4,
    "end_seconds": 406.0,
    "text": "No one knows your weaknesses or your flaws like you do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.066",
    "end": "00:06:48.600",
    "start_seconds": 406.06600000000003,
    "end_seconds": 408.6,
    "text": "But at the same time, you can be your biggest cheerleader,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.600",
    "end": "00:06:52.033",
    "start_seconds": 408.6,
    "end_seconds": 412.033,
    "text": "and no one can push you further or take you higher."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.100",
    "end": "00:06:57.366",
    "start_seconds": 412.1,
    "end_seconds": 417.366,
    "text": "I implore you, no, I beg you, look deep within on that next challenge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.600",
    "end": "00:06:58.733",
    "start_seconds": 417.6,
    "end_seconds": 418.733,
    "text": "Find your inner"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.733",
    "end": "00:07:00.433",
    "start_seconds": 418.733,
    "end_seconds": 420.433,
    "text": "go-getter"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.433",
    "end": "00:07:03.166",
    "start_seconds": 420.433,
    "end_seconds": 423.166,
    "text": "and see how far it can push you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.166",
    "end": "00:07:04.533",
    "start_seconds": 423.166,
    "end_seconds": 424.533,
    "text": "I've been there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.533",
    "end": "00:07:06.600",
    "start_seconds": 424.533,
    "end_seconds": 426.6,
    "text": "Have you? Contest Chair."
  }
]
